MLA Standard: MLA.PC.PA.12
Question:
In polar coordinates, what does the ordered pair (r,theta) describe in item  Use item context 1 to select the best answer.
{
~A. Horizontal and vertical coordinates only #This choice uses a related idea but does not complete the required reasoning for the stated standard.
